{
  "id": "paper-torn-reveal",
  "name": "Torn-paper photo reveal",
  "mode": "print",
  "technique": "The frame is covered by paper strips with seeded torn edges (clip-path polygons); they are torn away one by one with a lift and spin, revealing a property photograph underneath, and a label is stamped on it. The photo is never altered.",
